  "_doc": "Canonical CamView modality registry. CamView is a fixed-feature AI product; the detection-model set is bounded (currently 12). Every exam Excel is a SUBSET of this catalogue. The channel code (3rd hyphen-segment of the Alarm ID, e.g. C-253813-{ch}-...) is the STABLE key. Alarm-type label text drifts across exams and is matched via aliases only as a fallback. evidenceFolder is the per-modality sub-directory name used in the exam's evidence drop. New CamView models extend this file; nothing else changes. `stage` places the model in the exam day: pre (box handling and room setup before the exam), during (only meaningful inside the exam window), whole (watched all day). FOP has no known channel yet and resolves by label.",
